# Nested globs matter here: `dashboard/` is COPYd wholesale by the dashboard
# build stage, and a host node_modules (with host-platform native binaries)
# copied into a linux image is both slow and wrong.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
tests
*.log
.env
**/.env
**/.env*.local
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
legacy
